        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global ED-RC051 Rim Cylinder Lock</b>\r\n<p>\r\nCommercial door rim cylinder lock. Rim cylinders are normally used on the doors exterior to unlatch <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Rim Panic Devices</b></a>. This solid brass rim cylinder includes mounting plate, trim ring and mounting screws. Available in Brushed Chrome or Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\"><b>Global Door Rim Cylinder</b></a> in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global ED-RC051 Rim Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Keyed Rim Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Standard 5-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Flat \"cut to size\" horizontal tail piece</li>\r\n<li>For 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Packed with 1-7/8\" diameter trim ring</li>\r\n<li>Includes mounting plate and two (2) #12 x 1-7/8\" machine screws</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Optional Brushed Chrome or Oil Rubbed Bronze</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
